{"publicId":"a408031e-f163-421a-ba38-d774384c085a","title":"迪士尼财报超预期致盘前股价上涨","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","digest":"迪士尼（Disney）11月17日公布的第三季度财报显示，营收达281亿美元（超预期3.5亿美元），净利润为23亿美元（超预期4.5亿美元），推动其盘前股价上涨2.3%至143.2美元。该结果符合公司此前对营收的预期，但净利润超出市场平均预期值约20%。受财报提振，迪士尼股价在美东时间周二盘后交易中一度突破143美元，较前收盘价上涨2.3%。公司未对具体业务增长原因进行详细说明，仅表示将加速流媒体和主题公园业务投入。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T22:47:56.476Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"英伟达股价在周二盘后交易中上涨","latestReport":{"id":"ltb94rpcpovn5v7ayah1uxynv"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fJiO-abtARTU","title":"迪士尼股价在盘前上涨","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ltb94rpcpovn5v7ayah1uxynv","title":"英伟达股价在周二盘后交易中上涨","summary":"英伟达在周二盘后交易中上涨，该公司公布了超出预期的财报表现。","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"ltb94rpcpovn5v7ayah1uxynv","title":"英伟达股价在周二盘后交易中上涨","summary":"英伟达在周二盘后交易中上涨，该公司公布了超出预期的财报表现。","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"ltb94rpcpovn5v7ayah1uxynv","title":"英伟达股价在周二盘后交易中上涨","summary":"英伟达在周二盘后交易中上涨，该公司公布了超出预期的财报表现。","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T21:00:00.000Z","he